# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify. Vercel reads the "redirects" block in
# vercel.json instead; each host ignores the other's file.
#
# The site used to be three documents and is now one narrative page. These two
# addresses were linked and indexed, so they keep resolving — as a real 308 at
# the edge rather than as an HTML bounce, which is faster and is what a
# crawler wants to see.
/pipeline   /#pipeline   308
/download   /#download   308
